{
    "title": "Satellite Map Live Navigation",
    "description": "Satellite Map Live Navigation helps users find the best route and distance between two locations. With Live Satellite View Location & GPS Live Navigation Map app you can share current location and its Route Finder feature provides options for the best routes available. GPS Maps Voice Navigation for driving is available to let your mobile speak your driving directions. Accessing the Live Earth Map allows you to explore nearby & world\u2019s famous places. Live Satellite Earth Map Navigation feature provides a top-down perspective of the Earth's map, showing road maps with real-time traffic updates. Using the Traffic Map View, you can pre-plan your route. As a premium tour guide and address finder, the Live Earth Map HD app find routes for nearby and famous places.\r\n\r\nA GPS Speedometer gives you real-time speed monitoring. Speed meter keeps an eye on your speed meter so you cannot go beyond the limit and have safe travels. Digital Compass in this Satellite Map: GPS Live Navigation app gives accurate map directions. Simply calibrate the compass and find directions.\r\n\r\n<b>Satellite View Map - 3D Live Earth View</b>\r\nLive Satellite View Map features a Live Earth Map of your current location or you can enter your location to get a 3D satellite map. Live Earth Map offers satellite views for exploring and finding locations. Use location finder to share your location with loved ones and navigate their locations. Real-time map directions are coupled with weather updates and a traffic map to help you plan your journey accordingly.\r\n\r\n<b>Voice Navigation & Driving Directions</b>\r\nWith GPS Voice Navigation, you will be able to receive voice commands and turn-by-turn directions via voice guidance. You won't have to look at your phone for map directions with Voice Navigation. Use voice navigation in conjunction with GPS route finder to navigate locations and get driving directions effortlessly. GPS Satellite Navigation Live Earth Map App enables users to find directions towards destination using voice instructions instead of typing that helps while driving.\r\n\r\n<b>Traffic Map - Real time Road Maps</b>\r\nSatellite Map Live Navigation will help users to see the traffic updates on the road maps. The traffic map shows the traffic intensity in various colours and allows you to view traffic information on a live earth map.\r\n\r\n<b>Route Finder - A True Route Planner</b>\r\nLive Earth Map app has GPS Route Finder feature which can measure distance and time travelled. Use GPS maps Route Finder to find the best routes around the world. Voice Route offers the ability to shortlist multiple routes by voice and then find the best route based on a live traffic map. Using the Route Planner, you can view the route in 3D in terrain and satellite views.\r\n\r\n<b>GPS Speedometer - An Incredible Speed Navigation</b>\r\nA GPS Speedometer and Speed calculator is available with real-time navigation capabilities. You'll never miss a beat with a speed navigation that ensures accuracy. Equipped with a digital compass ensures you never lose your way. Upgrade your travel experience and let our GPS Speedometer & Speed mileage app guide you to your destination with confidence.\r\n\r\n<b>Key GPS Navigation Features in Satellite Map: Live GPS Navigation App</b>\r\n\u25cf Live Satellite Map View\r\n\u25cf Share Location easily\r\n\u25cf GPS Route Finder to Navigation Routes\r\n\u25cf Voice Navigation for easy driving directions\r\n\u25cf GPS Speedometer with Distance, Average & Maximum speed\r\n\u25cf Map directions using a digital compass\r\n\u25cf Area Measurement Calculator to measure area on Live Earth Map\r\n\r\nDiscover, navigate, and explore with Satellite Map Live Navigation; your all-in-one app featuring stunning 3D Satellite view map, GPS Route Finder with Traffic Map View, Maps Navigation, Speed Meter, Area Measurement Calculator and Compass.",
